<section id="join-related-tables-safely" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="join-related-tables-safely">6. Join related tables safely</h2>
<p>Product names belong in a product table, not repeated in every transactional source. The <code>validate</code> argument converts an assumption about key uniqueness into an executable check.</p>
