<section id="common-mistakes" class="level2">
<h2 class="anchored" data-anchor-id="common-mistakes">Common mistakes</h2>
<ul>
<li>Filtering after aggregation when the question requires filtering observations first.</li>
<li>Treating missing values as zeros without a domain reason.</li>
<li>Joining on a non-unique key and silently multiplying rows.</li>
<li>Overwriting the only copy of raw data.</li>
<li>Reporting a group average without the group size.</li>
</ul>
</section>
